abstract: "An offline-first research AI system that introduces Cognitive AI architecture, complete salience, focus, memory hierarchy and an asynchronous, dream-like, memory consolidation loop. The implementation of Cognitive AI Architecture also serves as a useful demonstration of how Cognitive Resonance thinking systems lead to a reduction of doublethink, dissonance, and confusion, encourage critical thinking patterns, and lead to truth seeking behavior, regardless of whether the intelligence is organic or artificial."
